  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: '3 Scatters triggers 10 Free Games and pay x2 total bet.

      4 Scatters
      triggers 15 Free Games and pay x5 total bet.

      5 Scatters triggers 20
      Free Games and pay x10 total bet.'
