  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_5
    value: <b><style=title><color=#ffdd00><size=32>LINES</color></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: 'Wild appears on all reels and substitutes for all

      symbols except        
      and'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: '3 Scatters on reels 1, 3 and 5 triggers

      Mighty Dragon Free Games.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: '- Tall Wild symbol nudges during Mighty Dragon Free Games.

      - Re-trigger
      is allowed.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_4
    value: "- 6 or more Re-Spin symbols anywhere on reels \n   trigger Drop and Lock
      Feature.\n- All spots become independent and Re-Spin \n   symbol (         
      or         ) or blank can appear.\n- Once all reels stop, ALL Re-Spin symbols
      drop \n   down to the bottom as much as possible.\n- A full row of Re-Spin
      symbols creates a win and \n   the prizes of Re-Spin symbols on this row are
      \n   awarded and then this row gets emptied.\n- Whenever there is a win, spin
      counter gets reset.\n-          Re-Spin symbols on a win row are collected
      \n   to unlock the locked area up to 7x5.\n- Each unlocked row adds Jackpot
      Re-Spin \n   symbols to reel strips by order from Mini to\n   Mega.\n- Re-Spin
      symbols that are not part of any win \n   rows, get dropped down and locked
      until \n   they make a win row."
